WEBVTT

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.070
A tattoo?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.570
Who are you?!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.000
There's nothing under the bed.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.840
Is this how you write "meat"?

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.960
Oh, you're awake?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.590
Whoa! What are you doing in my room?!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.590
And you, you can't just 
rummage through my desk!

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.890
Isn't looking for porno in a boy's room

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.930
Glint

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.520
part of being a Japanese gentleman?

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.770
And aren't you supposed to write "meat" 
on sleeping people's foreheads?

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.900
Right, Tom?

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.150
<i>That's not "meat," it's "crease." That's 
hard to write. She even added ruby text!</i>

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.150
Crease

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.190
I don't get you.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.590
Surprise Attack

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.050
That's right...

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.920
I was about to be killed by that bear guy.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:41.510
If your tattoo hadn't activated,

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.010
you may well have died.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.020
My tattoo...

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.640
So, Seigi-kun...

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.060
What? You're getting awfully friendly.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.940
I'll get right to the point.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.280
I want you to join us.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.320
What?

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.070
We're with the US Army.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.950
Our mission is to retrieve the tattoos 
that were taken from the country

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.330
by a certain researcher.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.040
Yours counts as one we need to retrieve.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.330
The army? You guys?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.370
But unfortunately for us,

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.920
once a tattoo is affixed to someone, 
it takes root in the body

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.170
and can't be easily removed.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.470
If you refuse to assist us,

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.590
we'll have to take one of 
your arms, at the least.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.350
At the least, mind you.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.350
H-Hey, hang on a second!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.980
Your tattoo creates a nothingness 
that swallows space,

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.690
or in other words, a void,

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.650
which is why it's called "Void Maker."

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.070
And it's quite unstable, at that.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.900
Failure to control it

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.570
has the potential to result 
in the user's death.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.280
Death?

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:51.080
But with our support, that can be prevented.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.630
We'll even make sure it hinders your 
current lifestyle as little as possible.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.130
Or would you rather

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.260
be devoured by Void Maker and die?

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.050
Cut the crap!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.760
I've heard enough!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.220
You're basically saying it's 
you guys' fault, right?!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.470
Yet instead of apologizing, 
you tell me to join you!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.930
Stop making this all about you!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.400
You're just a kid, anyway! 
Who do you think y—

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.240
If I may remind you, you're the 
one who wanted the power.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.910
And you ended up getting it.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.740
You can't get what you want 
without just compensation.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.790
Just look what happened to me.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.290
I'm in a child's body forever.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.880
I'll give you time to think about it.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.630
Let's meet again soon.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.840
Goodnight.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.260
I look forward to a favorable response.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.980
What the hell is this?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.310
I transferred here from Los Angeles. 
I'm Bluesy Fruesy.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.310
You can call me Izzy.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.730
That girl...

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.320
Wh-Why?!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.070
She's hot...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.570
She's cute!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.570
Seigi-kun!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.240
Everyone be nice to her.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.200
If you're not, I'll get you. That is all.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.130
Nice to meet you, Izzy-san!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.670
What are your measurements?

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.170
What celebrity do you most 
want to he held by?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.550
Your Japanese is so good! 
Where'd you learn it?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.840
Your hair's so pretty! 
Is the color natural?

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.180
Izzy-san, do you know Akatsuka-kun? 
What's your relationship?

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.350
Well...

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.690
Let's just say it's not 
your normal relationship.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.860
Whoa, hey...

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.440
Hold it!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.660
As Seigi's guardian, I cannot 
allow that remark to slide!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.910
You're the girl who was 
stalking Seigi, aren't you?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.120
What is it that you want?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.040
Y-You've got it all wrong! 
This is not funny, seriously!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.080
Protagonist-type guys like you are 
supposed to swim in the sea, right?!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.540
So off you go!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.340
You're Ichinose Touko, right?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.140
Akatsuka-kun's childhood friend.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.010
How do you know that?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.680
Are you jealous? How cute.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.980
I like that kind of thing.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.440
I-It's not like that.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.530
<i>That chest is unbelievable.</i>

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.820
<i>She's developed way too much.</i>

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.530
S-Stop... Stop it...

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.330
My chest... I...

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.960
Whoa, something very sexual is going on!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.960
Please, stop...

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.010
Stare

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:35.470
Time to start class. 
Please take your seats.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.690
What's wrong with all you boys?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.440
<i>Guess I went too far...</i>

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:53.360
Wow! A Japanese specialty, 
the geisha Fujiyama wall slam!

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:57.330
Shut up! What the hell are you thinking, 
transferring into my class?!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.620
Being close to you will make 
things more convenient, won't it?

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:04.040
Well, I had intended to ask you 
this elsewhere on a later date,

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.540
but now works just as well.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.340
What's your answer?

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.350
You said that your body is the 
compensation for your power, right?

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.390
The lieutenant is older than me.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.440
Her body stopped growing

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.690
when the tattoo was affixed to her.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.190
Her actual age is—

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.400
Just like with drugs,

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.950
there are side effects if your 
constitution isn't compatible.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.580
Mine was a rare case, though.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.950
I-It is not as though

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.830
we know everything about tattoos, either.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.420
Y-You're really toughing it out...

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.960
You see, tattoos are ancient relics

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.380
that modern humans are not 
capable of creating.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.970
Ancient relics?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.430
I'm suggesting this for your benefit.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.390
Not that you have the luxury of choice...

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.060
Does getting involved with the army mean

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:10.110
I'll have to do anything 
dangerous or dirty?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.480
I won't deny it.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.450
<i>If power is justice,</i>

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.330
<i>then I want to get stronger.</i>

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.410
<i>From the moment I decided to 
follow in my dad's footsteps,</i>

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.370
<i>I was prepared for danger.</i>

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.210
Just tell me one thing.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.050
Why are you guys in the army?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.920
To prevent war from breaking out.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.340
We're maintaining a precarious 
balance at the moment,

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.140
but there is deep-seated tension 
between America and the Kingdom.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.930
And the Kingdom's knowledge and technology

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.190
regarding tattoos far exceeds America's.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.400
If they were to use tattoos as 
weapons of mass destruction...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.280
Fine. I'll join you.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.910
This sounds shady as hell,

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.870
but you sound honest about 
wanting to prevent a war.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.210
But if I ever think what you 
guys are doing is wrong,

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.750
I'll stop you with all I've got.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.130
That's my condition.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.130
That's fine.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.930
Then allow me to formally introduce myself.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:22.220
I'm Lieutenant Bluesy 
Fruesy of the US Army.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.640
I'm Sergeant Tom Shredfield.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.060
Welcome to Team Blue Moon.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:27.770
Thanks.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.770
Whoops, sounds like lunch break's over.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.780
We'll continue this here.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.740
Oh, right. Just be careful around blood.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.660
When you were fighting yesterday, 
I figured out your tattoo's trigger.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.000
It's blood.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:47.910
Blood?

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.120
It wouldn't have been surprising if

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.080
you'd been swallowed by the void then.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.640
He's so naïve.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.890
You persuaded him well.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:07.810
For now, it's enough to make him see the 
pros and cons without making him anxious.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.440
Telling the truth is not always 
the right thing to do.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.900
So, how should we report back home?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.070
We won't. Not for a while.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:20.950
Huh?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.370
We'd be sent back home, 
and then he'd be used as lab rat.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.120
He's the Sealed for the triggerless tattoo,

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.290
whose match we couldn't find before.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.420
But we can't hand him over to the Kingdom.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.380
Then it would be best for him

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.800
to be kept under our supervision, correct?

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:43.470
We'll have him get used to 
using the tattoo first.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.680
He can help us with our work after that.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.600
Now that he's involved with that,

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.350
he's a part of our world, 
whether he wants to be or not.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.530
Aren't you giving him a bit 
too much special treatment?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:04.120
I didn't know you were so concerned 
with being a humanitarian.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.920
I shouldn't have said that.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.590
It's starting to rain.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:24.010
I'll hail a taxi.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.890
What's the situation?

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.220
We've taken control of most 
of the principal facilities.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.390
And we of Brahman have

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.350
eliminated the king's bodyguards.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.770
Supporters of the king in the military 
are resisting around the castle,

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.780
but it's only a matter of time.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.820
Good.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.910
Kumbhakarna.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.830
Devour him down to his last bone.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.450
My foolish father needs no grave.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.670
Captain Ajita, proceed to the 
next stage of the plan.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:42.050
As you wish, Princess Aryabhata.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.340
Capturing a country is but a minor event.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.300
In terms of RPGs,

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.140
it's like acquiring a world map.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.430
The Dragon King tried to give 
half of the world to the hero,

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.230
but that's not enough.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.190
I will have every last grain of sand,

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.610
drop of water, and breath of air

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.280
on this planet for myself.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.210
<i>I should make sure Touko</i>

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.880
<i>doesn't find out about Izzy.</i>

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.300
<i>I don't want to get her involved.</i>

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.090
Suspicious...

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.730
Tomorrow 
Saturday 
17:00 
Come

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.730
Here!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.400
Jeez, you could've given 
this to me normally...

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.700
This is the house, right?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.870
<i>This is the US Army's secret hideout?</i>

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.660
<i>So what's inside?</i>

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.600
Don't scare me like that!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.780
<i>Yes, yes?</i>

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.120
<i>If you're selling newspaper 
subscriptions, please go away.</i>

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.370
Huh?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.910
<i>No religious solicitations either, please.</i>

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.660
Um, ah...

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.290
It's Akatsuka.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.330
<i>Oh, Seigi-kun?</i>

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.880
<i>Oh, okay! Just a moment.</i>

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:51.220
I'm sorry about that.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.760
Glint

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.300
We've had a problem with solicitors lately.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.680
<i>He looks like he's making 
himself at home here!</i>

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.600
Well, come on in.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.640
Th-Thanks.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.150
Pardon me while I go change.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.900
Feel free to look around.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:06.570
Uh, sure.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.400
Definitely suspicious.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.400
Ever since Izzy-san showed up,

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.160
it seems like Seigi is avoiding me.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.660
If he's getting into dangerous stuff again,

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.450
I have to stop him!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.290
<i>Wait, doesn't this make me the stalker?</i>

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.710
This isn't really a good idea.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.460
I'm going to grill him when he gets home!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.690
What...?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.660
<i>It's more normal than I expected.</i>

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>In fact, it's totally normal.</i>

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:05.750
<i>There's nothing that really 
stands out as being military.</i>

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.590
<i>"Tom"? As in...</i>

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.470
A bunny!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:24.640
What's wrong?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.190
Hello?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.860
<i>Hey, it's me, Izzy.</i>

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.150
<i>Are you at the house already?</i>

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.940
Yeah, no thanks to you.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.450
<i>Sorry! I'll be home soon. 
Can you wait there for me?</i>

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.530
What? You told me to come, 
and you're not even here?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.160
<i>You can ask Tom any questions 
you have, while you wait.</i>

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.460
<i>He's useless in individual battles,</i>

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.340
<i>but he knows all sorts of things.</i>

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:50.420
Is that the lieutenant?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.250
<i>Okay, I'll see you soon!</i>

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.380
Wha— Wai— Hey! Hello? Hello?!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.970
Oh? Now the home phone is ringing.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.310
Huh? That's a phone?

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.890
Seigi-kun, I'm sorry,

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.810
but could you bring the cardboard 
box up from the basement?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.690
We'll be needing it later.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.110
It's down the hall.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.280
Oh... Sure.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.190
Hello?

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.240
<i>A basement, huh?</i>

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.990
<i>This seems like secret hideout stuff.</i>

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.830
A coup d'état in the 
Kingdom of Selinistan?!

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:27.960
<i>Yes. It was just reported 
that Princess Aryabhata</i>

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.210
<i>killed the royal couple 
and took the throne.</i>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.420
It can't be!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.010
Princess Aryabhata is 
an infamous hardliner.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.090
If she's become the new 
leader of the Kingdom...

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.930
That changes things immensely.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.470
What is this place?

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.770
It's bigger than the above-ground part...

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.400
Is this even legal?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:52.980
Ah.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.610
Oh, yes! I must inform the lieutenant!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.290
This is not the time!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.790
Yes, yes, yes? Who is it?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:25.430
I-It can't be... So soon?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.930
You aren't him.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.100
Whoa, wait!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.560
Tom-san, is this the cardboard box you—

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:40.820
I found the Sealed of the 
triggerless tattoo.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.870
Touko?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.630
Whew, the last one's all set.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.670
That took longer than I expected.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:59.510
Now I just need to fix the 
settings for incoming calls...

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.800
Huh? Why is it already ringing?

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.680
Is that a device for detecting 
the ripple in space

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.980
that occurs when a tattoo is activated?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.400
Impressive.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.240
I intended to tear apart 
your flesh, as well.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.120
I'd expect no less of Blue Moon's 
Lieutenant Bluesy Fruesy.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.660
Are you an envoy from the Kingdom?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.960
I can't believe the wise king

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.540
would allow something like this.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.380
The king and queen just

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.380
recently passed away.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.640
The new ruler of my Kingdom

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.260
is Princess Aryabhata.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:54.060
I'm a member of the princess's 
personal tattoo force, Brahman,

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.400
the "Behemoth Viper," R. R. Lakha.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.650
I'm 22, single, looking for a girlfriend.

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.110
And by the way, I'm a total sadist.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.490
To annihilate the young ones 
working behind the scenes

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.950
and retrieve the triggerless tattoo...

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:12.080
That was my master's royal decree!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:15.370
Dance! Dance, little bunny!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.420
How thrilling to be able to torment my idol,

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.670
Mandy Rabbit,

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.800
to my heart's content!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.880
I like that look on you.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:29.220
That immature body is just irresistible!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.810
I think junior is about to

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.930
fly up to Seventh Heaven!

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.640
I hate vulgar men.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.400
You barely messed with my skirt...

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.480
You sure have great taste.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.190
I'm honest with my lower body, that's all.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.820
The way this is going, I assume there's 
a guest visiting my house, too?

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.580
Bingo.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:02.170
I will take the triggerless 
tattoo back to the princess.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.510
Why...?

00:23:41.770 --> 00:23:43.650
There's no way to defend against

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:46.020
the void produced by Void Maker.

00:23:46.020 --> 00:23:49.240
Promise me that you won't use 
it without my permission.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.280
Now, let's continue our lesson.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.570
Next time: "Misery Loves Company."

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.080
Misery Loves Company
